WEBVTT

00:03:29.076 --> 00:03:31.076
but you know you deeply believe it,

00:03:31.076 --> 00:03:33.196
I say ask yourself three questions.

00:03:33.196 --> 00:03:36.636
And if the answer is yes to all three,
you say the thing.

00:03:36.676 --> 00:03:38.956
OK, so the three questions are:

00:03:38.996 --> 00:03:40.156
Do I mean it?

00:03:40.156 --> 00:03:41.396
This question is important

00:03:41.436 --> 00:03:45.516
because you're not just talking
to hear your own voice.

00:03:45.556 --> 00:03:48.636
Do you actually mean
what you're about to say?

00:03:48.676 --> 00:03:49.836
Can I defend it?

00:03:49.836 --> 00:03:51.276
OK, if somebody challenges you

00:03:51.316 --> 00:03:53.396
on this thing that you
are also challenging,

00:03:53.436 --> 00:03:56.396
do you have a way to justify
and back it up?

00:03:56.396 --> 00:03:58.116
Do you have a clear way to say,

00:03:58.116 --> 00:04:00.316
"These are the receipts I'm coming with"?